# The repository stores LF, always.
#
# This is not cosmetic: committing from a shell where core.autocrlf is off stores
# CRLF, which turns a five-line edit into a whole-file diff and makes the next
# reader review a rewrite where nothing was rewritten.
* text=auto

# A test fixture with deliberately broken framing has to survive checkout
# byte-for-byte on every platform.
test/fixtures/** -text